<h2>Monday, May 17,  2004</h2>	
<div class="post">
	 <h3 class="storytitle" id="post-9"><a href="http://www.marksportal.net/index.php?p=9" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Ouch!">Ouch!</a></h3>
	<div class="meta">posted by: Mark @ 11:43 pm </div>
	
	<div id="wplinks" class="storycontent">
			<p>I did something to my back, though I&#8217;m not sure what, so I write in pain.   You never know just how important those back muscles are until you can&#8217;t move.</p>
	<p>The final touches for this blog are finally done.  It took a bit to figure out how to remove some of the features that I didn&#8217;t need.  I also played around with the stylesheets a bit to integrate it with the rest of the site.  So I&#8217;m finally to a point where I&#8217;m satisfied with it.   It&#8217;s been awhile since I&#8217;ve worked on my website, so this was a fun little project.   I think my next project will be to convert the site from being table dependent to more <a href="http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS/">CSS</a> dependent.  I&#8217;m also considering adding a <a href="http://www.photoblogs.org/">photoblog</a>, but I think I&#8217;ll hold off on that for a bit longer.   My current photo section is good enough for now.</p>
	</div>
	
